*   Production Signatures: "Slumber-Patching" (feeding unquantized Eurorack CV loops sampled from monastic EEG monitors straight into snappy sidechained synth leads), hyper-gloss vocal layering stacked 40 voices deep over room-mic’d upright acoustic jazz instruments, and sweeping 24-piece symphonic string glissandos that slide directly into 808 pitch-bends.
